---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | MockAgent.AI"
  description="Privacy Policy for MockAgent.AI. How we use cookies, analytics, and advertising."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Last updated: September 27, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p>
        MockAgent.AI (“we,” “us,” or “our”) operates the website https://www.mockagentai.com. This Privacy Policy 
        explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We do not require visitors to create an account to read our content. We may collect standard server logs 
        and usage data through analytics tools, such as:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on page</li>
        <li>Referring website or search query</li>
        <li>Approximate location (country/region level)</li>
        <li>Browser type, device type, and screen size</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. We use cookies and similar 
        technologies to keep the site working, understand how visitors use it, and deliver relevant content and 
        advertising.
      </p>

      <h3>Types of cookies we use</h3>
      <table class="cookie-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Category</th>
            <th>Provider</th>
            <th>Purpose</th>
            <th>Duration</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Essential</td>
            <td>MockAgent.AI</td>
            <td>Remember your cookie preference and keep the site secure.</td>
            <td>1 year</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Analytics</td>
            <td>Google Analytics</td>
            <td>Understand how visitors navigate the site and which content is most useful.</td>
            <td>Up to 2 years</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Advertising</td>
            <td>Google AdSense and partners</td>
            <td>Serve ads and measure their performance. May be personalized if you consent.</td>
            <td>Up to 2 years</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>Managing your consent</h3>
      <p>
        When you first visit MockAgent.AI, we show a cookie banner where you can accept or reject non-essential 
        cookies. You can update your choice at any time by clicking <strong>Cookie settings</strong> in the footer.
        Rejecting non-essential cookies means we will not load Google Analytics or Google AdSense scripts, but the 
        site will continue to work normally.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can also manage or delete cookies through your browser settings. For more information, visit 
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">AboutAds.info</a> or 
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Google AdSense</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar 
        technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of 
        personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a> 
        or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">AboutAds.info</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        For more information on how Google uses data from sites that use its services, visit 
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">Google's Privacy & Terms site</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Our articles may link to vendor websites, review platforms, or regulatory resources. We are not responsible 
        for the privacy practices of third-party sites. We encourage you to read their privacy policies before 
        submitting personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics and advertising data are retained according to the policies of the respective service providers. 
        We do not collect or store sensitive personal information such as Social Security numbers, health records, 
        or insurance policy details through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, delete, or restrict processing 
        of your personal data. To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:mockagentai@gmail.com">mockagentai@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with 
        a revised “Last updated” date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at 
        <a href="mailto:mockagentai@gmail.com">mockagentai@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    background-color: var(--white);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .page-lead {
    color: var(--slate-gray);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .cookie-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .cookie-table th,
  .cookie-table td {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .cookie-table th {
    background-color: var(--white);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cookie-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
    background-color: rgba(22, 35, 63, 0.02);
  }
</style>
